---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const title = "Privacy & Cookies | Night Sky Journey";
const description = "How this website stores preferences and handles contact inquiries.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="min-h-screen pt-32 pb-20 px-6 md:px-12 bg-background text-secondary">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-10">
      <header class="space-y-4">
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl text-primary tracking-tight">
          Privacy &amp; Cookies
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-secondary">Last updated: 27 November 2026</p>
        <p class="text-lg font-light leading-relaxed">
          This notice explains the browser storage used by this site and what happens when you send
          a contact inquiry.
        </p>
      </header>

      <section aria-labelledby="browser-storage-heading" class="space-y-4">
        <h2 id="browser-storage-heading" class="font-serif text-2xl text-primary">
          Browser storage
        </h2>
        <p>
          The site does not set cookies for these preferences. It uses your browser's
          <code>localStorage</code> to remember your light or dark theme choice and whether you dismissed
          the demo banner. These values stay in your browser and are not sent to the website with requests.
          They remain until you clear this site's data in your browser.
        </p>
        <p>The site does not currently use analytics or advertising trackers.</p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="contact-data-heading" class="space-y-4">
        <h2 id="contact-data-heading" class="font-serif text-2xl text-primary">
          Contact inquiries
        </h2>
        <p>
          <strong class="text-primary">Data controller:</strong> Costel Moraru.
          <strong class="text-primary">Privacy contact:</strong>
          <a href="mailto:" class="underline hover:text-primary">
            moraru_costel at yahoo com
          </a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you submit the contact form, it collects your name, email address, and message. This
          information is used to respond to your inquiry and, where relevant, take steps you request
          before a potential agreement. Do not include sensitive personal information.
        </p>
        <p>
          Form submissions are sent securely to Web3Forms, which processes them to deliver the
          inquiry to the site operator. Web3Forms says submission data may be retained for up to
          three years, and that its spam-prevention providers may process submitters' IP addresses
          and email addresses. Its infrastructure may process data in India and other regions; its
          <a
            href="https://web3forms.com/privacy"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="underline hover:text-primary"
          >
            privacy policy
          </a>
          and
          <a
            href="https://web3forms.com/dpa"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="underline hover:text-primary"
          >
            data processing agreement
          </a>
          describe its processing and transfer safeguards.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="your-rights-heading" class="space-y-4">
        <h2 id="your-rights-heading" class="font-serif text-2xl text-primary">Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          You can contact the controller above to request access to, correction or deletion of your
          information, or to exercise other rights available under data-protection law. You may also
          lodge a complaint with your local data-protection authority.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
